{"path":"\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/' data-target='root' data-title=''>&#8962; <\/a>\r\n\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer' data-target='computer' data-title='Computer'>\r\n\t\t\tComputer\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os' data-target='computer\/os' data-title='OS'>\r\n\t\t\tOS\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n\t\t<a class='XURL content-link' href='\/computer\/os\/windows' data-target='computer\/os\/windows' data-title='Windows'>\r\n\t\t\tWindows\t\t<\/a>\r\n\t\t<span class='path-separator'>\\<\/span>\r\n","async":"0","desc":"Working notes on 10: Guest account, Interactive service, Personalize, Start menu, and Windows Apps.","label":"10","prevArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/msi","label":"MSI","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/msi"},"nextArticle":{"id":"computer\/os\/windows\/n7","label":"7","url":"\/computer\/os\/windows\/n7"},"languageSwitcher":"<div id='language-switcher'>\n<\/div>\n","content":"<div id='message'>\n\t<p>\n\t\tWorking notes on 10: Guest account, Interactive service, Personalize, Start menu, and Windows Apps.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Topics<\/h2>\n\t<h4>Guest account<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tAdd a Visitor account, remove it from Users, and put it in Guests.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Interactive service<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tNoInteractiveServices can show a service on the parallel session screen, but it cannot take input.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Personalize<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tFlat login-screen colour with DisableLogonBackgroundImage, Theme colour, or desk.cpl Advanced.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Start menu<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tPin shortcuts from %Programs%, fix custom .url shortcuts, and how Start menu hash uses Target only.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>Windows Apps<\/h4>\n\t<p>\n\t\tCopy WindowsApps with robocopy \/E \/COPYALL \/DCOPY:DAT.\n\t<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div id='updated-container'>\r\n\t<div id='updated'>\r\n\t\tUpdated:\r\n\t\t